<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: elder ogren -->
  <OE_Elder_Ogren.label>远古奥格伦</OE_Elder_Ogren.label>
  <!-- EN: Obsidia Ogren are huge and very strong creatures. By themselves, they are not aggressive unless disturbed. Their strength allows them to carry huge loads, which makes them excellent pack animals.\n\nBut deep beneath the Obsidian caverns, one Ogren remained untouched by civilization—feeding off minerals rich in psychic residue and absorbing the silent whispers of ancient forces. When the EGO Seed took root in its massive frame, it didn’t resist—it accepted.\n\nNow risen as the Elder Ogren, this titan moves with dreadful purpose. Its blows can shatter stone, and its presence incites terror in nearby foes. What once was a docile giant has become a living bulwark, awakened by raw primal instinct and otherworldly power.\n\nElder Ogrens are even rarer and more dangerous than the typical Ogren. -->
  <OE_Elder_Ogren.description>黑曜石奥格伦是巨大而非常强壮的生物。它们本身并不具有攻击性，除非受到打扰。它们的力量使它们能够携带巨大的负载，这使它们成为优秀的驮兽。\n\n但在黑曜石洞穴深处，有一只奥格伦未被文明触及——以富含心灵残留物的矿物为食，吸收着古老力量的无声低语。当EGO种子在其巨大的身躯中扎根时，它没有抵抗——而是接受了。\n\n现在作为远古奥格伦崛起，这个巨人带着可怕的目的移动。它的打击能够粉碎石头，它的存在让附近的敌人感到恐惧。曾经温顺的巨人已成为活生生的堡垒，被原始本能和超凡力量唤醒。\n\n远古奥格伦比普通的奥格伦更加稀有和危险。</OE_Elder_Ogren.description>
